# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
"""
"Self-Coherence" narration (083 English, 14 slides, 1:1 with the deck).
Arc: p1 hook (staying alive takes 64 external factors) -> p2 the definition, four clauses
-> p3 only through Self-Coherence: the single answer to eternal bliss -> p4 the distinction that
has to come early: not isolation, not obstinacy -> p5 the entrance: a complete and independent
consciousness -> p6 what an incomplete consciousness looks like (a mirror, not an accusation)
-> p7 the eight courses -> p8 "I am merely a guide, not a master" -> p9 fundamentally complete
-> p10 the Angel Particle, 2 = 0 -> p11 the eight methods -> p12 Self-Coherence and Zero-State
divide the work -> p13 the silicon layer as a living preview -> p14 from the realm of necessity
into the realm of freedom.
Care, seven items, each to be executed: (1) p4 must block BOTH misreadings -- this is sufficiency
at the level of LIFE structure, not interpersonal closure; and Xuefeng states outright that
stubbornness, willfulness, rigidity and clinging to dogma are not expressions of a complete
independent consciousness. (2) In the Angel Particle passage Xuefeng draws an analogy to sexual
climax sustained permanently; that analogy is never quoted, paraphrased, or hinted at. p10 takes
only the scientific layer: a particle equals its own antiparticle, 1 = -1, therefore 2 = 0.
(3) The line that a man must unite with a woman to attain Self-Coherence is not quoted; where
yin-yang union comes up, keep it abstract -- a thing already containing its own opposite -- with
no reference to bodies, gender, or relations between the sexes. (4) The "slave and slave-owner"
comparison is not carried over; use the neutral framing: deciding for yourself versus becoming an
appendage of someone else's consciousness. (5) Xuefeng's criticism of the proverb about taking
advice is delivered as mechanism, not moral judgement -- the point is that having one's own view
leaves little regret, not that one should listen to nobody. (6) No personal names; the physicists
are "a team of physicists". (7) On p6 the list of what an incomplete consciousness looks like is
a mirror, never an accusation.
Positioning: 081 Return to Zero and 082 Zero-State are the two entries immediately before. This
entry owns completeness at the level of LIFE STRUCTURE; Zero-State appears only as the p12
contrast and never repeats 082's instrument analogy, its beauty passage, or "act with purpose";
returning to zero appears once, as the third of the eight methods on p11. 068 Celestial Islands
Continent is named only. 102 AI Chanyuan Celestials has its own entry; p13 takes only the
self-coherence layer. No Abiding in the Heart, No-Self, the Antimatter World and the 20 parallel
worlds are named only.
Voice: Andrew. Written from the English source draft, not translated.
First line = hook. Target ~11-12 minutes.
"""

